WEBVTT

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.250
It sure is creepy.

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:31.370
E-07, eh?

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:34.290
How long has it been
since the military closed it down?

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:35.830
Nine years.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:40.580
Really? You've been to 07 before?

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:43.910
There's only a ghost town
and an insect cage left, right?

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:45.750
Hey.

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:47.250
Let him be.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:51.330
You wanna go to E-05, right?
I'll wake you up when we get there.

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:28.870
So, that's E-05...

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:36.450
-Wow, what a big city!
-Oh, well...

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:40.500
That's E-01. They say they have
six times the population of this town.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:41.500
Six times?!

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:43.910
It's the headquarters
of the E number areas!

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:47.870
Supplied with electricity and water 24/7,
it's the megacity of your dreams!

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.250
Really...

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:52.500
And I thought 05 was a big city.

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:56.370
Area E used to have
another big metropolis before,

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:58.790
but it was attacked by bugs.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:00.950
Kidow, it's already noon.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.870
Come on, it's not like I have work.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.870
Must be nice to be an Exterminator!

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.790
Just one Cagaster head
will feed you for a month.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.540
Makes me feel stupid working every day.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.410
Sir, please keep quiet within the store.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:18.040
Here! Even if you have the day off,
wake up a little earlier.

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:20.290
I can't wash the sheets.

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:22.410
-My bad.
-My!

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:23.790
Be careful!

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:26.950
You don't know what an Exterminator
might do if you get too close.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.540
Hey, that's about enough!

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:31.620
Oh, as long as it's Kidow,
I won't mind anything he does.

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:37.080
Even if he wasn't an Exterminator,
he's already troublesome.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:39.080
I know that, so have no worries.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.870
Now, I'll be off!

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:45.910
I...

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:47.540
I'll go out to eat.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.160
The demon!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:53.160
The demon laid his hands on our sanctuary!

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.790
Ilie! You're going over
to the kids' place, right?

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:01.620
You wanna ride halfway?

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:05.330
I won't be inconsiderate and show my face.

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:07.700
I'll drop you off in front of West Street.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:09.790
Just in time!

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.950
Once it's done processing,
we'll deposit it into your usual account.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.410
It's the usual. Give it to Hadi for me.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:32.750
Hadi?

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:34.750
He's gone now.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.500
Depending on the region,
a military soldier

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:40.160
can be executed for letting
a Cagaster outbreak go.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:42.950
You have to realize
getting fired is a small price to pay.

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.200
He doesn't look familiar.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:46.660
They're from 01.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:50.700
They're here for an inspection or
something, but it sure is uncomfortable.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:53.500
You don't need to worry!

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:57.250
I know she was pretty upset,
but Lizzy ain't that weak.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.540
I'm sure if she sees your face,
she'll cheer up--

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:01.660
Lizzy!

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:03.910
Ilie.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.580
Somebody! There's a kidnapper!

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.370
-Hey, stop! Get off!
-You can't have Lizzy!

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:11.330
Get out, you bastard!

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:14.080
Ouch! I said stop! Hey!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.700
Swear that you won't sell off Lizzy!

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:18.330
I told you I'm not trying to!

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:19.830
Hadi?

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:21.160
Naji.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.290
Hey, help me out here!

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:31.910
Scholarship?

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:35.700
Isn't that where you get money
to go to school?

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:40.040
Yeah. Qasim asked an acquaintance
to become her guardian.

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:41.540
She passed the screening.

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:44.500
She's always been a smart girl.

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:48.160
If she studies hard in 01's school,
she'll have a better future.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:52.910
If that was Qasim's last wish,
I'd like to at least make it come true.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:01.750
-Lizzy...
-Lizzy!

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:04.080
I heard! That's awesome!

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:06.620
Can't believe this town
would produce a scholar!

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:10.080
I've never been to 01, but I hear
it's a big and pretty place--

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:11.080
I'm not going.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:13.250
Why me?

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:16.160
I'm gonna stay with everyone
and create a band of thieves!

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.160
They burned my house, killed my mom,

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:20.500
and then shoved us into these slums...

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:22.250
It might be to make up for that,

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:24.830
but now they want me to go study at 01?

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:26.410
That's enough!

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:28.790
I'm not listening to anybody!

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.160
Nor am I going anywhere!

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:34.200
I don't want to lose anyone
or anything anymore!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:35.870
Why you?

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.620
Because you're a girl, of course!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.830
A band of thieves, my butt!

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:43.750
You live like a pickpocket!

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:46.330
You only got away until today
because you were lucky!

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:48.950
One day you'll get caught, beat up,

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:51.290
and they'll sell or kill you in the end!

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:53.370
-Stop, stupid Naji!
-Don't bully Lizzy!

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:55.750
Don't you guys care
what might happen to Lizzy?!

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:00.200
You know how your parents
ended up trying to feed you guys.

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:01.370
Stop.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:03.450
I don't wanna hear it.

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:04.790
Lizzy!

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:08.540
The Exterminator dude handed me that.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.410
It was Qasim's.

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.160
It's not for Qasim.

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:15.700
I'm saying this because I want you
to have a better life, Lizzy.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:18.000
You can't stay in a place like this.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.000
If you have the chance to get out,
take it.

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:23.080
Can't I stay?

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:25.450
All I want...

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:29.080
is just to stay together with everyone...

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:39.040
Lizzy wants to think about it a little.

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:43.950
There's an interview and an exam still.
Though, it's not for a while...

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:48.160
01's school focuses heavily
on the guardian's background.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:52.540
If she passes that, then the rest is up
to how well she does in school.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:53.660
Really?

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:57.870
So, he was a do-gooder
till the very end... that guy.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:07:59.700
What about you?

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.080
What?

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:06.410
I was asked by your dad
to bring you to your mom's place.

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:13.370
But I don't even know what she looks like.
I don't know where she is, either.

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:16.120
Can't I just stay here...?

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:17.660
Don't ask me...

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:20.790
Oh, yeah, where'd you meet Hadi--

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:34.370
-Kidow?!
-Taking a walk!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:35.830
At this hour?!

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:46.790
<i>An Exterminator is a sword.</i>

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.290
<i>Be a part of the penetrating steel...</i>

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:53.120
<i>What do I do in times like this, Qasim...</i>

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:03.040
<i>Was it my imagination? No...</i>

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:11.160
Visiting a grave empty-handed?

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.540
Hey, I heard you were looking for me.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:18.660
Qasim's relatives?

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.290
You're quite considerate.

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:24.950
Didn't find any, huh? They were killed
by Exterminators long ago.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.790
Qasim's hometown was a small village,

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.080
and it was under the control
of an Exterminator guarding it.

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:37.040
His parents who resisted him were killed
as a warning to the others.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:40.410
That's why every time
he saw an Exterminator...

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.120
I always find out...

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.450
when everything's over.

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:48.290
It's not a job you can do
if you know too much, right?

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.080
I'm not being bitter.
I appreciate what you did.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.500
I'm glad you were the one
who sent my partner off

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:56.080
while he was still human.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.120
So! You wanna have a drink today?

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.290
I'm broke. Treat me, Mr. Kidow!

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.910
Forget it. Go to the job center.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:09.410
We need to talk.

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:12.830
<i>It's about your young lady.</i>

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:19.450
Jeez, in a place like this...

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:24.080
-Here, come on in! Sorry, it's tight!
-Gosh.

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:26.540
And?

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:31.200
Okay, you know how there's
been soldiers coming in from 01 lately?

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:34.250
There was something odd inside
01's records.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:35.540
You sneaked them out?

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:38.040
Don't worry. They're just copies.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:41.160
"List of Cagaster outbreak patients
within Area A.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:44.870
Outbreak of one male staying at A-47.

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:48.700
Deaths and property damages, zero.
Unable to exterminate."

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:52.370
A Cagaster flew off
without attacking a human?

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:54.790
That was exactly three months ago.

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:59.040
That was around the same time
Ilie came here, too, right?

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:02.660
A-47 was where she was from originally.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:03.830
That's not all.

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:07.700
<i>I heard a story from a traveling merchant.</i>

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:11.200
<i>A guy from the caravan staying</i>
<i>in that village</i>

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:14.910
<i>had a sick hobby and dragged</i>
<i>a village girl into the forest.</i>

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:19.580
<i>The other merchants and the villagers</i>
<i>who noticed searched around.</i>

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:24.080
<i>And they found a shepherd's child standing</i>
<i>between the village girl and the guy.</i>

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:27.410
<i>The guy was partially Cagasterized </i>

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.830
<i>and crouched as if serving her,</i>

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.330
<i>but he soon became a full Cagaster</i>

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.790
<i>and flew off somewhere</i>
<i>without attacking anyone.</i>

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:41.580
<i>They say that the shepherd's child...</i>

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:44.330
<i>was a girl</i>
<i>with braided silver blonde hair.</i>

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:47.950
<i>Hello!</i>

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:54.330
If that was Ilie, I was wondering
if you might know anything.

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:58.540
I've never heard this kind of story.

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:00.330
Sorry.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:03.160
I just wanted some kind of a clue.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.580
More so than about her,

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:08.830
<i>I wanted to know what the guys</i>
<i>from 01 are up to.</i>

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.120
<i>I got a bad feeling about them.</i>

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:16.870
<i>A Cagaster flew away</i>
<i>without attacking anyone...</i>

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:23.580
<i>They say that the shepherd's child</i>

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:26.580
<i>was a girl</i>
<i>with braided silver blonde hair.</i>

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:30.790
<i>That was exactly three months ago.</i>

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:34.660
<i>That was around the same time</i>
<i>Ilie came here, too, right?</i>

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:39.950
Welcome back.

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:42.620
-Where's Ilie?
-I think she's in her room.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:43.620
Wait, Kidow!

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:52.250
Jeez! I told you not to come in
without asking!

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:57.910
Today, I changed rooms.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:02.450
Ms. Mario said that she couldn't
let me live in a storage room forever.

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:05.450
Kidow, what's wrong?

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:09.540
You two were attacked by bugs, right?

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:15.910
That's right.

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:19.910
I fell unconscious,
so I don't remember clearly...

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:23.330
-but our whole car was attacked--
-And then?

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:27.290
I'm sorry.
I don't really want to remember it.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.330
Let me ask you one thing.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.250
If you were attacked
without a bodyguard,

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.750
-why weren't you guys eaten?
-What?

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:39.500
Hey!

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:41.540
Who are you people?!

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.870
Gather everyone inside!

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:47.080
Anyone who resists
will receive a well-deserved punishment!

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:48.950
This is an official warrant

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:51.950
from Area E Inspector-General
of the Eastern Allied Forces!

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:54.620
Watch the back door!
Don't let anyone escape!

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:11.870
Please don't be too rough with them.

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:14.620
My daughter has been
in their care after all.

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:25.080
Did she get away?

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:27.290
They knew our moves.

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:31.200
According to our info, she's with
the Exterminator of the Far East.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:33.450
Wow, isn't she popular!

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:35.450
She is Tania's daughter after all.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:37.040
This is no time to be joking!

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:39.950
Don't worry, she can't get away.

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:43.410
The spell Griffith cast is now broken.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.160
Hey, what is it? What's happening?

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:54.750
Who knows?

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.500
Then why did we run?

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.620
Hey, let's get back.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:01.660
I'm worried about Ms. Mario and everyone.

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:03.540
Let's go.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.120
Hey! Where are we going?

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.330
You're too loud. Shut up and walk.

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:14.910
What are you doing? Get up!

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:18.250
No! You're acting strange today, Kidow.

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:21.500
Where are we going? Why do we have to run?

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:24.410
Strange? You're the strange one.

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:26.620
-Me?
-About what I was saying earlier,

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:30.410
how come you didn't get injured
after being attacked by bugs?

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:32.790
I told you I don't remember!

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:34.580
Why are you asking me this?

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.250
It doesn't matter right now.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:38.160
-It does!
-What?

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.370
There should've been

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:43.620
a Cagaster that flew away
without eating anyone at your village.

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:47.450
Those soldiers from 01 are here
with that information.

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:50.450
-They're looking for you.
-Why?

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:52.950
I'm asking you
'cause that's what I wanna know!

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:54.950
If we don't know their goal,

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:56.830
we can't make our next move.

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:01.450
Ilie, I'm sure you remember something!

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:03.910
It can be anything. Think back!

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:08.580
No!

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:11.580
What was that just now?

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:13.580
-There they are!
-Freeze!

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:19.660
Hand over the girl!

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.290
If you resist, we'll shoot!

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:30.500
Damn it...

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:35.200
After them!

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:38.000
Freeze!

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:46.410
You guys, quickly!

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:47.410
Lizzy!

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:55.450
Ilie, what happened?

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:57.290
I'm sorry...

00:16:57.580 --> 00:17:00.540
You don't need to apologize,
but are you okay?

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:05.330
There's a ton of escape routes
the military doesn't know of.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:09.910
They can regret ignoring the slums. But...

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:13.040
if they get enough people,
even this place can be dangerous.

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:17.120
If you're really gonna run,
you guys should leave 05 before morning.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:19.620
I'll show you the shortcut.

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:22.700
-Kid.
-It's Naji!

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:24.700
Thanks for earlier,

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:26.750
but don't get involved anymore.

00:17:26.950 --> 00:17:30.120
There it is.
You're saying you're fine by yourself?

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:33.040
That's not it. I don't even know

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:35.870
what I'm dragging you guys into right now.

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:39.500
To be honest, I don't even know
if running was right.

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:45.040
You could be assisting a crime
without knowing it.

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:49.200
Hey, bro, are you on Ilie's side?

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.660
Ilie's an important friend.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:54.950
I don't care if it isn't right.

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:59.750
We don't have anything more important
than friends.

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:03.000
If you're running for Ilie,

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:05.290
then that's enough reason to get involved.

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.700
But don't pick on Ilie!

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:14.790
Any guy that makes a girl cry
is a scumbag!

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:18.830
You're mature, kid.

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:20.290
I said I'm Naji!

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:28.750
Don't worry. Just talk it out, okay?

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:33.370
-Come on, you guys.
-Okay.

00:18:33.450 --> 00:18:34.950
-Okay.
-Ilie...

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:39.000
I said too much earlier.

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:40.540
Will you forgive me?

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:44.580
If you don't want to remember,
that's fine.

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:47.660
We'll be on the run for a while.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.410
We'll leave 05 tonight.

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:55.910
If we get out of Area E,
they can't reach us that easily.

00:18:56.500 --> 00:19:00.000
But we'll be fugitives.
We'll never be able to return.

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:02.160
Are you ready for that?

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:05.700
With me...

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.370
You'll come with me?

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:13.000
I'm the only one they're after, right?

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:17.660
If you're okay with it, I'll go with you.

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:21.870
Yes, I want to go with you.

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:24.660
Please!

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:27.080
Don't leave me by myself!

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:40.750
<i>There's a backstreet that</i>
<i>the tax-evading caravans use.</i>

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:43.080
<i>If we can hop on with them,</i>

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:45.660
<i>we won't have to go through a checkpoint.</i>

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.910
You sure are used
to this kind of bad stuff!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:52.250
Take care! I'll pray it goes well.

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:53.830
You, too, Lizzy.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:55.750
Everyone, take care.

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:59.580
There's no escape other than death.

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:02.660
Ilie!

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:08.830
Stay back!

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.000
Kidow!

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:14.290
I'll catch up later. Take her!

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:15.660
-But!
-Ilie, let's go!

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:17.000
-Let's go!
-Kidow!

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:22.040
-Kidow!
-Hurry, Ilie!

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:33.290
I hear you're famous in the Far East,

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.620
father-killing Exterminator.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:40.620
What happened?

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:45.250
Did you run all the way here
in fear of your colleagues' revenge?

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:47.750
It seems you can't escape trouble.

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:52.500
Even after fleeing here,
you still get chased by this monster.

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:07.290
You always block me
when I attack your right side.

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:09.330
I gambled on it and bingo.

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:16.080
You still have half a human body
and claim to be a "monster."

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:17.700
What...

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:19.790
are you?!

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:24.040
That's the serial killer from before?

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:27.450
-That bro fought him off once, right?
-Yeah.

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:30.000
We'll be okay if we hide here, right?

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:34.000
Nim!

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:37.500
-Hey, street rats!
-Nim... No, Nim...

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:39.750
You don't wanna mess with grown-ups.

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:41.500
Let go of Nim!

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:46.620
Hey, don't move. We were told
to not kill that girl there.

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:50.000
You guys gotta be punished.

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:54.540
Stop!

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:57.120
Nim!

00:21:58.870 --> 00:22:00.000
Now! Run--

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:00.950
Little brat!

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:02.410
Naji!

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:25.000
You're a pretty half-assed Exterminator

00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:28.580
to be killed by a half-monster like me.

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:33.200
Lizzy!

00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:36.450
Don't get so carried away!

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:41.120
You guys just stay crawling
on the ground like this.

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:46.330
Stop it! I'm the one you want, right?

00:22:46.700 --> 00:22:48.250
Don't hurt anyone else!

00:22:48.700 --> 00:22:50.950
Hear that? What do we do?

00:22:51.330 --> 00:22:54.500
We're gonna kill them all. What else?

00:22:55.080 --> 00:22:56.450
Jeez, fine.

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:02.870
Qasim, help us.

00:23:03.950 --> 00:23:06.200
I got sand in my eyes.

00:23:06.450 --> 00:23:07.370
Hey.

00:23:07.830 --> 00:23:09.500
What are you gonna do about it, huh?

00:23:15.200 --> 00:23:17.830
Ilie, forgive me. This...

00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:22.580
is all I can do in the end...

00:23:23.870 --> 00:23:24.790
No...

00:23:27.910 --> 00:23:30.500
It's been fun... Griffith.

00:23:44.000 --> 00:23:45.330
Lizzy is 13,

00:23:46.200 --> 00:23:48.370
-and Naji is nine, right?
-What?

00:23:50.870 --> 00:23:54.500
You can't have a Cagaster outbreak
if you're under 15 years old.

00:23:55.500 --> 00:23:58.250
Come on, do your best
to beg for your life.

00:23:58.330 --> 00:24:00.450
If I like it, I might let you go.

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:03.870
Go to hell, you bastard.

00:24:04.620 --> 00:24:06.870
Die, little scum!

00:24:17.290 --> 00:24:18.200
That idiot...

00:24:24.120 --> 00:24:27.450
What was that? Hey.

00:24:40.000 --> 00:24:42.120
-A Cagaster!
-What are you doing?!

00:24:42.250 --> 00:24:43.290
Run, Ilie!

00:24:44.120 --> 00:24:47.500
Who is your master, Cagaster?

00:24:48.500 --> 00:24:50.870
If you understand, then do as I say.

00:24:52.700 --> 00:24:54.370
What the hell are you...

00:25:21.660 --> 00:25:22.870
I had a dream.

00:25:25.790 --> 00:25:27.750
It was a beautiful dream...

00:25:29.450 --> 00:25:31.160
but once dawn comes and I wake up...

00:25:33.500 --> 00:25:35.790
I'll forget everyone.
